  // ---- №343 · «Рисовалка ИТК»: сотрудник диктует или пишет по-русски → DeepSeek переводит в описание для рисовалки → Wanxiang рисует ----
  case 'art_draw': {
    $s = authUser('itc'); art_table();
    $d = body();
    $ru = mb_substr(trim((string)($d['text'] ?? '')), 0, 800);
    if (mb_strlen($ru) < 3) fail('Скажите или напишите, что нарисовать');
    $ratio = in_array(($d['ratio'] ?? ''), ['sq', 'wide', 'tall', 'banner', 'post', 'news'], true) ? $d['ratio'] : 'sq';
    $style = in_array(($d['style'] ?? ''), ['photo', 'art', 'free'], true) ? $d['style'] : 'photo';
    $en = '';
    try {
      require_once __DIR__ . '/ai_lib.php';
      $sys = 'You turn a Russian description into one detailed English prompt for an AI image generator. Keep every object, place, color and detail the user asked for, add helpful visual details (composition, lighting, background). '
           . ($style === 'photo' ? 'The result must look like a real professional photograph. ' : ($style === 'art' ? 'The result must look like a beautiful high-quality digital illustration. ' : ''))
           . 'If the user wants text on the picture, put that exact text in double quotes. Answer with the prompt only, no explanations.';
      $en = trim((string)itcai_ask($sys, $ru, 400, 30));
    } catch (Throwable $e) { $en = ''; }
    if ($en === '') $en = $ru;   // перевод не получился — отдаём как есть (рисовалка понимает и по-китайски, и частично по-русски)
    $size = ['wide'=>'1280*720', 'tall'=>'720*1280', 'banner'=>'1440*576', 'post'=>'1024*1280', 'news'=>'1280*800'][$ratio] ?? '1024*1024';
    $tail = $style === 'photo' ? ', realistic professional photo, natural light, sharp details, high resolution' : ($style === 'art' ? ', high quality detailed digital illustration' : '');
    $neg = ($style === 'photo' ? 'cartoon, illustration, drawing, 3d render, ' : '') . 'watermark, logo, blurry, low quality, deformed hands, extra fingers';
    $r = ds_draw($en . $tail, $size, $neg, 'wanx2.1-t2i-plus');
    if (!empty($r['err'])) fail($r['err']);
    $id = 'a' . bin2hex(random_bytes(6));
    $dir = dirname(__DIR__) . '/apps/draw/img'; if (!is_dir($dir)) @mkdir($dir, 0755, true);
    $f = '/apps/draw/img/' . $id . '.jpg';
    $im = @imagecreatefromstring($r['img']);
    if ($im) { @imagejpeg($im, dirname(__DIR__) . $f, 90); imagedestroy($im); } else @file_put_contents(dirname(__DIR__) . $f, $r['img']);
    db()->prepare('INSERT INTO itc_draw (id, phone, who, prompt_ru, prompt_en, ratio, style, file) VALUES (?,?,?,?,?,?,?,?)')
       ->execute([$id, (string)($s['phone'] ?? ''), mb_substr((string)($s['name'] ?? ($s['staff_name'] ?? '')), 0, 100), $ru, mb_substr($en, 0, 1500), $ratio, $style, $f]);
    jout(['ok'=>true, 'id'=>$id, 'file'=>$f, 'en'=>$en]);
  }
