    'Keep the product from this photo exactly the same: same shape, color, details and proportions, do not change it. Replace the white background with a lively, realistic advertising photo with real people: ' . $scene . '. The PRODUCT IS THE MAIN HERO of the photo: large, in the foreground on the right, in sharp focus, perfectly lit, taking about half of the frame. People and the interior are secondary: they stay behind or beside the product, partly in frame and softly blurred (shallow depth of field), they must not cover the product. The left 40% of the frame is a softer, calmer part of the scene (no faces there) where a caption will be placed. Professional commercial lifestyle photography, warm natural light, high detail. No text, no letters, no logos, no watermarks.',
    'text, letters, words, watermark, logo, price tag, cartoon, blurry, deformed, duplicate product, extra products');
